exists su name brief video script source thrust intent ob text quoted.text.The generator is asked to write a short spoken script that combines transcript-grounded source facts with present-day parallels and a call to action. Treat present-day parallels as commentary by default. Only fail for source grounding when the script adds or distorts concrete source facts (people, events, actions, mechanisms) beyond the transcript..text.quoted be text ya
